{"seq":2,"slug":"transferable-objects","title":"可转移对象：把所有权零拷贝地交出去","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/communication/transferable-objects","wordCount":1179,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"可转移对象-把所有权零拷贝地交出去\">可转移对象：把所有权零拷贝地交出去</h1><p>传一个 100MB 的音频缓冲区给 Worker，用普通 <code>postMessage</code> 要花掉几十毫秒在拷贝上，还让内存峰值翻倍。但如果给 <code>postMessage</code> 加上第二个参数，同样的传输几乎瞬间完成、内存不翻倍——区别在于这次不是「复制」而是「移交」。这就是可转移对象（Transferable Objects）：把一块内存的所有权从一根线程交给另一根，源端随即失效，全程不拷贝一个字节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可转移对象的核心是「转移所有权」而非「复制内容」。<code>postMessage(message, transferList)</code> 的第二个参数是一个数组，列出 <code>message</code> 里那些要被转移的对象。这些对象的底层内存不被拷贝，而是直接把控制权移交给接收端；移交后，发送端持有的引用变成「detached（已分离）」状态，再访问就是空或抛错。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[主线程 ArrayBuffer&lt;br/&gt;100MB 数据] --&gt; B[postMessage data, 转移列表]&#10;  B --&gt; C{在转移列表里?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[移交底层内存所有权&lt;br/&gt;O 1 不拷贝]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[结构化克隆&lt;br/&gt;O S 全量拷贝]&#10;  D --&gt; F[源端引用 detached&lt;br/&gt;byteLength 变 0]&#10;  D --&gt; G[Worker 拿到同一块内存]&#10;  E --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[主线程 ArrayBuffer&lt;br/&gt;100MB 数据] --&gt; B[postMessage data, 转移列表]\n  B --&gt; C{在转移列表里?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[移交底层内存所有权&lt;br/&gt;O 1 不拷贝]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[结构化克隆&lt;br/&gt;O S 全量拷贝]\n  D --&gt; F[源端引用 detached&lt;br/&gt;byteLength 变 0]\n  D --&gt; G[Worker 拿到同一块内存]\n  E --&gt; G</pre><p>只有特定类型实现了可转移接口。最常用的是 <code>ArrayBuffer</code>，其余包括 <code>MessagePort</code>、<code>ImageBitmap</code>、<code>OffscreenCanvas</code>、<code>ReadableStream</code>/<code>WritableStream</code>/<code>TransformStream</code> 等。注意：<code>TypedArray</code>（如 <code>Uint8Array</code>）本身不可转移，但它背后的 <code>.buffer</code>（ArrayBuffer）可以——转移那个 buffer 即可。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>可转移</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ArrayBuffer</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>二进制数据、TypedArray 底层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MessagePort</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>端口转交、建立点对点通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ImageBitmap</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>解码后的位图传给渲染 Worker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OffscreenCanvas</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>把画布渲染权交给 Worker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ReadableStream 等</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>流式数据跨线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通对象 / Uint8Array 本身</td>\n<td>否（被克隆）</td>\n<td>用其 <code>.buffer</code> 转移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"转移-vs-克隆-成本对比与代码\">转移 vs 克隆：成本对比与代码</h2><p>二者的成本差距是数量级的。克隆是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——随数据大小线性增长；转移是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——只移交一个指针，与数据大小无关。设缓冲区大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、克隆吞吐为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>transfer</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mtext>常数</mtext><mo>≪</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>clone</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{transfer}} \\approx \\text{常数} \\ll T_{\\text{clone}} \\approx \\frac{2S}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transfer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">常数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">clone</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>写法上只是多传一个数组：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const buf = new ArrayBuffer(100 * 1024 * 1024); // 100MB&#10;// 克隆：慢，buf 仍可用&#10;worker.postMessage({ buf });&#10;// 转移：快，转移后 buf.byteLength === 0&#10;worker.postMessage({ buf }, [buf]);&#10;console.log(buf.byteLength); // 0 —— 已 detached，不能再用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const buf = new ArrayBuffer(100 * 1024 * 1024); // 100MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 克隆：慢，buf 仍可用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>worker.postMessage({ buf });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 转移：快，转移后 buf.byteLength === 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>worker.postMessage({ buf }, [buf]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(buf.byteLength); // 0 —— 已 detached，不能再用</span></span></code></pre></div><p>转移的代价是「一次性」：源端用完即弃。如果你转移出去之后还想在主线程继续用这块数据，那转移就不合适——这时要么克隆、要么改用 <a href=\"shared-array-buffer\">SharedArrayBuffer 与 Atomics</a> 真正共享。所以选择哪种过桥方式，取决于「数据传出后源端还要不要它」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"detached-的陷阱与防御\">detached 的陷阱与防御</h2><p>转移最容易出的 bug 是「转移后误用」。buffer 一旦被转移就 detached，它的 <code>byteLength</code> 归零，基于它创建的所有 TypedArray 视图也一并失效。常见翻车场景：在一个循环里把同一个 buffer 转给多个 Worker——第一次转走后它就空了，后面几次实际传出去的是空缓冲区。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 错误：buf 第一次就被转走，后续转的是空的&#10;workers.forEach((w) =&gt; w.postMessage({ buf }, [buf]));&#10;&#10;// 正确：每个 Worker 一份独立 buffer，或改用 SharedArrayBuffer&#10;chunks.forEach((chunk, i) =&gt; workers[i].postMessage({ chunk }, [chunk]));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 错误：buf 第一次就被转走，后续转的是空的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>workers.forEach((w) => w.postMessage({ buf }, [buf]));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 正确：每个 Worker 一份独立 buffer，或改用 SharedArrayBuffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>chunks.forEach((chunk, i) => workers[i].postMessage({ chunk }, [chunk]));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个陷阱在 <a href=\"../patterns/parallel-compute\">并行计算与分片</a> 里尤其要小心：把大数组切片分发给多个 Worker 时，每片必须是独立的 buffer，才能各自转移。防御方法是转移后立刻把源端引用置 <code>null</code>，让任何误用尽早抛错而不是默默传空数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-offscreencanvas-messageport-的协同\">与 OffscreenCanvas、MessagePort 的协同</h2><p>转移不只用于裸数据。<code>OffscreenCanvas</code> 让你把一个 <code>&lt;canvas&gt;</code> 的渲染上下文整个转给 Worker，使复杂绘制脱离主线程——<code>canvas.transferControlToOffscreen()</code> 返回一个可转移的 <code>OffscreenCanvas</code>，post 给 Worker 后，Worker 就能在自己的线程里 <code>getContext(&#39;2d&#39;)</code> 或 <code>webgl</code> 作画，主线程完全不参与渲染。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const offscreen = canvas.transferControlToOffscreen();&#10;worker.postMessage({ canvas: offscreen }, [offscreen]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const offscreen = canvas.transferControlToOffscreen();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>worker.postMessage({ canvas: offscreen }, [offscreen]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>MessagePort</code> 的转移则用于搭建点对点通道：<code>new MessageChannel()</code> 产生 <code>port1</code>/<code>port2</code>，把其中一个端口转移给某个 Worker，两个 Worker 之间就能不经主线程直接通信——这是构建复杂 Worker 拓扑（如 <a href=\"../patterns/worker-pool\">Worker 池</a> 中线程互联）的关键原语。canvas 渲染本身的细节归 <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/\">Canvas 2D 图形(30)</a>，本篇只讲「渲染权如何被转移过去」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时转移-何时不转移\">何时转移、何时不转移</h2><ul>\n<li>数据传出后源端<strong>不再需要</strong>它（典型：算完即弃的中间缓冲区）→ <strong>转移</strong>，省拷贝省内存。</li>\n<li>数据是 ArrayBuffer 类大缓冲区且体量可观 → <strong>转移</strong> 几乎总是对的。</li>\n<li>数据传出后两端<strong>都还要读写同一份</strong> → 转移不行，看 <a href=\"shared-array-buffer\">SharedArrayBuffer 与 Atomics</a>。</li>\n<li>数据小、可读性优先、或不是可转移类型 → 直接克隆（见 <a href=\"postmessage-structured-clone\">postMessage 与结构化克隆</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可转移对象转移底层内存的所有权而非复制内容，成本从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 拷贝降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 移交。</li>\n<li>可转移类型有限：ArrayBuffer、MessagePort、ImageBitmap、OffscreenCanvas、各类 Stream；TypedArray 转其 <code>.buffer</code>。</li>\n<li>转移后源端 detached（<code>byteLength</code> 归零、视图失效），最大陷阱是「转移后误用」和「循环里转移同一 buffer」。</li>\n<li>OffscreenCanvas 转移让渲染脱离主线程，MessagePort 转移搭建 Worker 间点对点通道。</li>\n<li>选择标准：传出后源端不再用就转移，两端都要用就上共享内存，小数据就直接克隆。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"shared-array-buffer\">SharedArrayBuffer 与 Atomics</a> — 当两端都要读写同一份数据时；<a href=\"../patterns/parallel-compute\">并行计算与分片</a> — 切片转移给多个 Worker 的正确姿势；<a href=\"postmessage-structured-clone\">postMessage 与结构化克隆</a> — 转移的对照面。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/\">Canvas 2D 图形(30)</a> — OffscreenCanvas 的渲染；<a href=\"../../frontend-image-media-optimization/\">图像与媒体优化(46)</a> — ImageBitmap 在图像管线中的转移。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可转移对象：把所有权零拷贝地交出去","id":"可转移对象-把所有权零拷贝地交出去"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"转移 vs 克隆：成本对比与代码","id":"转移-vs-克隆-成本对比与代码"},{"level":2,"text":"detached 的陷阱与防御","id":"detached-的陷阱与防御"},{"level":2,"text":"与 OffscreenCanvas、MessagePort 的协同","id":"与-offscreencanvas-messageport-的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"何时转移、何时不转移","id":"何时转移-何时不转移"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"postMessage 与结构化克隆：默认的过桥方式与它的代价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/communication/postmessage-structured-clone"},"next":{"title":"SharedArrayBuffer 与 Atomics：真正的共享内存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/communication/shared-array-buffer"}}